bar(true, "")
//│ ∀κ, λ ◁ {κ ≥ Bool, κ ≤ (Int ▷ {λ ≤ Int}) ∨ (⊤ ▷ {λ ≤ Str}), λ ≥ Str, λ ≤ Str}. Str ∨ (Int ▷ {λ ≤ Int, κ ≤ Int}) ∨ (Str ▷ {λ ≤ Str})

